WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
So imagine running the single most successful

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:07.520
hospital network in America.

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.160
Like you are literally outperforming 99% of the country

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.640
on well, basically every conceivable quality metric.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.280
Right, your readmissions are down,

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.120
your chronic care is world-class.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:21.840
Exactly, patient satisfaction is just off the charts.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:24.120
And the federal government's reward

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.320
for this unprecedented excellence

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.680
is to just aggressively slash your funding

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.440
by 40% compared to some mediocre hospital

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.280
