00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.480
Which sounds completely absurd.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:36.680
It sounds made up, right?

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.000
But that isn't a hypothetical scenario.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.080
Right now in American healthcare,

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:43.240
excellence is being actively penalized

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.960
by this broken math equation.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.800
It really is a phenomenal contradiction.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.080
I mean, you're looking at a scenario

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.520
where the statutory formula

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.240
that's meant to sustain healthcare delivery

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:53.800
is essentially cannibalizing the best performing market

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.880
in the entire nation.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.120
And that is exactly what we were unpacking today.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.520
And you know, if you're listening to this

00:00:58.520 --> 00:01:01.160
and you live in Florida or Arizona or Texas,

