Exactly.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:17.960
So they have completely objectively mastered

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:19.960
the CMS quality parameters.

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.160
They have.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:25.040
Which makes the benchmark reality so incredibly jarring.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.120
I mean, for 2026, the average benchmark for Puerto Rico

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.040
is just $730 per member per month.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.920
Well, the national average is $1,246.

