or Southern California or Arizona,

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.040
your fee for service pool is shrinking

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.480
every single open enrollment period.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:17.320
It is.

00:08:17.320 --> 00:08:19.040
Eventually, those states are gonna hit

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:22.360
the exact same mathematical singularity Puerto Rico

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:26.600
just hit where the FFS sample size becomes way too small

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.400
to generate a statistically valid benchmark.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.960
Puerto Rico is the canary in the coal mine.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:34.200
They just hit the extreme end of the curve

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.840
a decade before the mainland.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.080
But recognizing that you are the canary

