Knowing the math is broken is easy.

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:47.040
Fixing it in Washington is a nightmare.

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:47.880
Exactly.

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.440
And this is where Governor Jennifer Gonzales

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:50.280
Colin steps in.

