00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:07.640
Just apply this 0.70 floor to us.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.560
It aligns Puerto Rico more closely with national norms

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:13.720
without disproportionately blowing up federal spending.

00:10:13.720 --> 00:10:14.960
It stops the bleeding,

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.800
it stabilizes the provider networks,

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.600
and it does so without triggering

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:21.160
a massive fiscal panic on Capitol Hill.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:22.840
And you really have to factor in the messenger here.

